  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Srebrenica Outreach Project - BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the 30th anniversary of the Srebrenica genocide in 2025, the Srebrenica Outreach Project aims to ensure that the benefits gained through previous UK-supported programmes are embedded into the long-term work of the Srebrenica Memorial Centre. After a year of reforming the institution&#x2019;s internal structure through the Srebrenica Self-Reliance Project, the focus now shifts to strengthening its public engagement and outreach. This next phase will build sustainable initiatives that enhance the Centre&#x2019;s visibility, reinforce its credibility, and ensure continued support from partners, contributors, and the wider public.</narrative>
  </description>
